+Bots can also have a **Webhook URL**. When a member mentions the bot, Campfire
+queues a JSON `mention` event with the author, room, message, a deep link, and
+the bot's room-specific posting URL. A webhook's `200` plain-text or HTML response
+is posted as the bot; a `204` response is ignored. Webhook delivery always runs
+outside the message-posting request.
